  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups water",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "4 Granny Smith apples - peeled, cored and sliced",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon cornstarch",
    "1 (17.25 ounce) package frozen puff pastry sheets, thawed",
    "1 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "1 tablespoon milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine 4 cups water, lemon juice, and apples in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z0Y6AafEwGQPaVohxtFml29V1Ak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step1-1597-ac91dfeae88c46c485f8509300fd732b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Drain water from apples, transfer to skillet, and cook for 2 minutes. Add brown sugar and cinnamon; cook for 2 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LXpnHIM7_kS3iTyKLbIZSBLFduY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step2-1606-d1e82c5a92d34736823bd5187752eb44.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cornstarch and 1 tablespoon water together in a small bowl. Pour into the skillet and mix well; cook until juices thicken, about 1 minute. Remove from heat; cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lnk0qXPluAA70OGs6h1rj-QHAbQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step3-1607-98aa668cb13c490aab3739f67bcc960e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Unfold pastry sheets; repair any cracks by pressing them back together. Trim each sheet into a square.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7wmFMWhPS0T-CyMZm4ciZKGj444=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step4-1611-96b88505f7c14d04a6645779c5a084d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each into 4 smaller squares. Spoon apples onto the center of each square. Fold over from corner to corner into a triangle shape; press edges together to seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5_RgoOfjNnauIwYDZo9bv_OHduk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step4-1614-b14167daddee46d1a39c9772a7a41079.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place turnovers on a baking sheet 1 inch apart. Bake until puffed and golden, about 25 minutes. Cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_71MCcc672EHXgclmTi5zOH2ekA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step4-1615-89894df885f74328a02aa9025c06dde1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix confectioners' sugar, milk, and vanilla together in a small bowl. Adjust glaze consistency by adding more sugar or milk as desired; drizzle over turnovers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9trdaVtHrVoxCUEOpzEgfR--Tr4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/59124-AppleTurnovers-mfs-Step7-1635-16f8723e4d4749b59b0655237ac98c72.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/59124/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
